OL,3,GNEWSAOne of murder-accused had 'beef'
OL,4,Awith teen before fatal stabbing, court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man accused of murdering a teenager
OL,8,Falong with three others had been
OL,9,Finvolved in a disagreement with him in
OL,10,Fthe weeks before he was stabbed to
OL,11,Fdeath, a court has heard.
OL,13,FTristan Kerr, 17, from Abertridwr, in
OL,14,FCaerphilly, bled to death in the street
OL,15,Fminutes after being stabbed in the
OL,16,Fheart and lung with a so-called Zombie
OL,17,Fknife on 5 February.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
