OL,3,GNEWSAOne of murder-accused had 'beef'
OL,4,Awith teen before fatal stabbing, court
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FConnor Palfrey, 25 from Abertridwr,
OL,8,FGeorgie Mears, 19, from Thornhill,
OL,9,FCardiff, Elexi Manny, 25 from
OL,10,FSenghenydd, Caerphilly, and Ricardo
OL,11,FElliot, 27 of no fixed address, all
OL,12,Fdeny murder through joint enterprise.
OL,14,FJoint enterprise means people who
OL,15,Fassist or encourage another person to
OL,16,Fcommit a murder can be convicted for
OL,17,Fthe same crime.
